{
    "title": "HiHello: Digital Business Card",
    "description": "HiHello: The Best Digital Business Card App\r\n\r\nJoin the future of networking with HiHello, the leading digital business card app trusted by professionals worldwide. With over a million biz cards shared monthly, HiHello is your essential tool for building and managing valuable business connections.\r\n\r\nBEAUTIFUL & CUSTOMIZABLE BUSINESS CARD MAKER\r\n- Make and personalize interactive virtual business cards with easy templates, designs, and colors. \r\n- Create stunning free electronic business cards with profile photos, or transform your vcard into a video business card. \r\n- Add unlimited content, include links, social media, video, PDF, payment apps, and more. \r\n\r\nEFFORTLESS SHARING\r\n- Share your card with anyone, even if they don\u2019t have the HiHello app. \r\n- Share with a branded QR code, link, email, SMS, widgets, social media, NFC, and more.\r\n\r\nBUSINESS CONTACT MANAGER\r\n- Your virtual Rolodex that helps you keep track of everyone you meet. \r\n- Manage your contact list with automated sorting, notes and tags to organize, and a timeline of who you met and when in the smart address book.\r\n- Easily save HiHello contacts into your phone or preferred contact manager.\r\n\r\nAI-POWERED BUSINESS CARD READER, SCANNER, AND TRANSCRIPTION\r\n- Instantly capture paper card contacts with the AI-powered business card scanner.\r\n- Built on multiple AI models with a human verification backup if needed, HiHello is the most accurate business card scanner app. \r\n\r\nVIRTUAL BACKGROUNDS\r\n- Stay on brand in virtual meetings or live streams with custom (or customizable) virtual backgrounds that link to your smart business cards.\r\n- Create personalized, branded backgrounds with a photo from our library, or upload your own.\r\n- Share what\u2019s most important with your audience by creating a specific card and virtual background QR code for your meeting or presentation.\r\n\r\nEMAIL SIGNATURES\r\n- Create professional, interactive, attention-grabbing signatures that are compatible with any email platform and correspond to your business card of choice.\r\n- Choose from multiple templates and styles.\r\n\r\nANALYTICS \r\n- Gain valuable insights into card usage, engagement, and lead generation with in-app analytics and data integrations.\r\n\r\nINTEGRATIONS \r\n- Integrate HiHello with the systems that matter most, including SSO, Active Directory, and CRMs like Salesforce and Hubspot.\r\n\r\nSECURITY & PRIVACY \r\n- HiHello is SOC 2 Type 2 compliant and meets the privacy requirements for EU GDPR, UK GDPR, CCPA, and the Australian Privacy Act. \r\n\r\nSCALE TO TEAMS\r\n- Plans built for teams of all sizes.\r\n- Leverage digital business cards, email signatures, and virtual backgrounds to present your brand consistently and generate and capture leads to grow your business\r\n\r\nABOUT HIHELLO \r\nHiHello is changing how everyone\u2014from individuals to Fortune 500 companies\u2014manages their most important contacts. It starts with a digital business card created to be delightful, customizable, and secure. HiHello\u2019s digital business cards unlock new opportunities, eliminate the expense and waste of traditional cards, and have a positive environmental impact. Hundreds of thousands of professionals worldwide trust HiHello to amplify the power of their network, and we\u2019re just getting started!",
    "descriptionHTML": "HiHello: The Best Digital Business Card App<br><br>Join the future of networking with HiHello, the leading digital business card app trusted by professionals worldwide. With over a million biz cards shared monthly, HiHello is your essential tool for building and managing valuable business connections.<br><br>BEAUTIFUL &amp; CUSTOMIZABLE BUSINESS CARD MAKER<br>- Make and personalize interactive virtual business cards with easy templates, designs, and colors. <br>- Create stunning free electronic business cards with profile photos, or transform your vcard into a video business card. <br>- Add unlimited content, include links, social media, video, PDF, payment apps, and more. <br><br>EFFORTLESS SHARING<br>- Share your card with anyone, even if they don\u2019t have the HiHello app. <br>- Share with a branded QR code, link, email, SMS, widgets, social media, NFC, and more.<br><br>BUSINESS CONTACT MANAGER<br>- Your virtual Rolodex that helps you keep track of everyone you meet. <br>- Manage your contact list with automated sorting, notes and tags to organize, and a timeline of who you met and when in the smart address book.<br>- Easily save HiHello contacts into your phone or preferred contact manager.<br><br>AI-POWERED BUSINESS CARD READER, SCANNER, AND TRANSCRIPTION<br>- Instantly capture paper card contacts with the AI-powered business card scanner.<br>- Built on multiple AI models with a human verification backup if needed, HiHello is the most accurate business card scanner app. <br><br>VIRTUAL BACKGROUNDS<br>- Stay on brand in virtual meetings or live streams with custom (or customizable) virtual backgrounds that link to your smart business cards.<br>- Create personalized, branded backgrounds with a photo from our library, or upload your own.<br>- Share what\u2019s most important with your audience by creating a specific card and virtual background QR code for your meeting or presentation.<br><br>EMAIL SIGNATURES<br>- Create professional, interactive, attention-grabbing signatures that are compatible with any email platform and correspond to your business card of choice.<br>- Choose from multiple templates and styles.<br><br>ANALYTICS <br>- Gain valuable insights into card usage, engagement, and lead generation with in-app analytics and data integrations.<br><br>INTEGRATIONS <br>- Integrate HiHello with the systems that matter most, including SSO, Active Directory, and CRMs like Salesforce and Hubspot.<br><br>SECURITY &amp; PRIVACY <br>- HiHello is SOC 2 Type 2 compliant and meets the privacy requirements for EU GDPR, UK GDPR, CCPA, and the Australian Privacy Act. <br><br>SCALE TO TEAMS<br>- Plans built for teams of all sizes.<br>- Leverage digital business cards, email signatures, and virtual backgrounds to present your brand consistently and generate and capture leads to grow your business<br><br>ABOUT HIHELLO <br>HiHello is changing how everyone\u2014from individuals to Fortune 500 companies\u2014manages their most important contacts. It starts with a digital business card created to be delightful, customizable, and secure. HiHello\u2019s digital business cards unlock new opportunities, eliminate the expense and waste of traditional cards, and have a positive environmental impact. Hundreds of thousands of professionals worldwide trust HiHello to amplify the power of their network, and we\u2019re just getting started!",
